<title>USA: Wiser Oil Co completes private offering.</title>
<headline>Wiser Oil Co completes private offering.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wiser Oil Co said Thursday it consummated a private offering of $125 million of 9-1/2 senior subordinated notes due 2007 through initial purchases by Solomon Brothers.</p>
<p>The company said $76.9 million of the net proceeds from the sale are being used to repay bank debt and the balance will be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
